# Tiwlo Mobile & Web Theme / Appearance Configuration
# Controls mobile browser status bar (address bar), headers, and dashboard background

# Mobile Browser Status Bar / Address Bar Theme Colors
# (This sets the color of the phone's top area above the URL bar)
VITE_STATUS_BAR_LIGHT=#FFFFFF
VITE_STATUS_BAR_DARK=#0B0F17

# Mobile Header & Top Navbar Background Colors
VITE_HEADER_BG_LIGHT=#FFFFFF
VITE_HEADER_BG_DARK=#111827

# Dashboard Page Background Colors
VITE_DASHBOARD_BG_LIGHT=#F6F8FB
VITE_DASHBOARD_BG_DARK=#0B0F17

# Brand Primary Color
VITE_THEME_PRIMARY=#0B57D0
